{"event_type":"review","id":"2a66c9e7652ed44e34f25fded5bbb403bd258ad3fd6f878af25b37c1c01b40e3","occurred_at":"2026-11-08T23:41:08Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/4a8496eb528e4b7cff3965f583570ca1e90d41e53783a2986a79b21788e68f82","sha256":"4a8496eb528e4b7cff3965f583570ca1e90d41e53783a2986a79b21788e68f82"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/3ff573b93261115c1fe664472995606c9c8d83d9453e6d72774d9d5cdfbb25f1","sha256":"3ff573b93261115c1fe664472995606c9c8d83d9453e6d72774d9d5cdfbb25f1"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/d7b93b8e582a0ad6aa8ea52ff16f7c197aef4252396008d1e60b69ceae3e9966","sha256":"d7b93b8e582a0ad6aa8ea52ff16f7c197aef4252396008d1e60b69ceae3e9966"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/00f28598a89ad8bebb3dae34a0cdafef3ee61e4254331cc91334adfbe569b5fa","sha256":"00f28598a89ad8bebb3dae34a0cdafef3ee61e4254331cc91334adfbe569b5fa"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/b727f95d6ce88237e7ca84fd57336cd5e1255179fa6ed972ddff822647fa292e","sha256":"b727f95d6ce88237e7ca84fd57336cd5e1255179fa6ed972ddff822647fa292e"}],"attempt_id":"40e0126273559a3b71264b3c3472dd549b48efe6025630059d330fa8dd8b6bbb:0:1","base":"f8034bfe63d0dd7deb99ebc1f815009062bb241a","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"fdf0d24cf1018f3b9226f791c354895d00c67b56","body":"**Serialize provenance values as strings.**\n\nFor `CQ_SELFHOST_DRIVER`, `cap()` returns an object. It also returns numbers and short arrays unchanged. `ProvenanceConfigSchema` rejects these values, so the composition header can fail validation and observation becomes indeterminate.\n\nSerialize the values and preserve the `provider/model` format expected by `test/config/provenance.test.ts:102-107`.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Suggested fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n-function cap(value: unknown): unknown {\n-  const text = typeof value === 'string' ? value : undefined;\n-  if (text === undefined && !Array.isArray(value)) return value;\n-  const flat = text ?? JSON.stringify(value);\n+function cap(value: unknown): string {\n+  const flat =\n+    value !== null &&\n+    typeof value === 'object' &&\n+    'provider' in value &&\n+    'model' in value &&\n+    typeof value.provider === 'string' &&\n+    typeof value.model === 'string'\n+      ? `${value.provider}/${value.model}`\n+      : typeof value === 'string'\n+        ? value\n+        : (JSON.stringify(value) ?? '');\n   return flat.length <= MAX_VALUE_CHARS\n-    ? value\n+    ? flat\n     : `${flat.slice(0, MAX_VALUE_CHARS)}… (${flat.length} chars)`;\n }\n@@\n-  const envValues: Record<string, unknown> = {};\n+  const envValues: Record<string, string> = {};\n@@\n-    env: envValues as ProvenanceConfig['env'],\n+    env: envValues,\n```\n\n</details>","id":"2d6af69a876dfdc9af295c76161e6b9097b49501d86f63598df7b48de45caffc","intervals":[[35,35]],"path":"src/config/provenance.ts","severity":"major","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Serialize provenance values as strings."}],"head":"5d98b50f90fca21400a6e73b0b6933e0b30c7516","head_tree":"067d49da10942551a3c39da201ad1d79467f9afa","input_scope":[{"blob":"a47930241a924abea20a68544e666f8d53a075cf","intervals":[[1,396]],"path":"src/config/env-registry.ts"},{"blob":"a403b3b391673228b433e95ae61934d3f3a8e376","intervals":[[1,12]],"path":"src/config/process-env.ts"},{"blob":"fdf0d24cf1018f3b9226f791c354895d00c67b56","intervals":[[1,50]],"path":"src/config/provenance.ts"}],"job_id":"40e0126273559a3b71264b3c3472dd549b48efe6025630059d330fa8dd8b6bbb:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"a47930241a924abea20a68544e666f8d53a075cf","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/config/env-registry.ts","reason":"bounded verified input